# a bare `jevcode` with no key anywhere (no --mock, every key variable unset, an empty HOME/XDG): the jev-only first-run
# wizard asks for the Jev provider and key only — never the generator; Ctrl-C at startup prints the fix block and exits 2
# (TUI-DESIGN-2 §1.1, §1.4)
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect Where do you reach Jev
sleep 0.4
send \x03
eof
